#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Chosen is a bold and minimalist theme for publishers who want to get their "
"visitors' attention and keep it. Present your best content in a simple, "
"uncluttered fashion on phones, tablets, and desktop computers with Chosen. "
"Use Chosen to start a blog, magazine, or news site in any niche: fashion, "
"business, gaming, food, travel. As a free theme, you can use Chosen for as "
"many sites as you want. It can even be used for video, podcasts, and "
"personal resumes. Now with WooCommerce support, you can also add an "
"eCommerce store to your website. Chosen is also fully compatible with the "
"new Gutenberg post editor. Preview Chosen now on desktop, tablets, and "
"mobile devices with the interactive live demo: "
"https://www.competethemes.com/demos/?theme=chosen"
msgstr ""

